This was my first time playing as a spellcaster, even though I could only
advance in healing. I eventually got all spells up to level 3 at 0% fail. I
did the protection racket and in the mines before Minetown I found a
bonesfile of a previous character that had died after finding another
bonesfile (two of several attempts to do the protection racket). This
netted me about 4000 zorkmids which got me about 10 protection points. I
got to the Minetown temple with 0 XP. I then went looking for a co-aligned
altar before going further to Minesend  because I needed to get my XP up.
Found a BoH lying around just before the sokoban level. Went all the way to
level 9 or 10 and didn't find even a single altar, so I did Sokoban (for an
amulet of reflection) then went back to Minetown to do a conversion (risky,
I know). I knocked holes in the temple walls and gathered heaps of rocks
and daggers. This method was taking for ever, due to the priest dodging and
summoning insects. I eventually just waited for him to come close enough
and thumped him with a rubber chicken.Started saccing with an ice box from
a shop, create monster spell and a bag of tricks from another shop. This
got me Mjollir, Vorpal Blade and Fire Brand. I wielded Vorpal Blade because
I didn't want to burn scrolls and potions. Then I finally proceeded to
mines end.

Continued on in the DoD until I found a co-aligned altar on lvl14 (I should
of kept looking earlier). Acquired a pet purple worm named Dr. Worm, who
lasted until late in Gehennom. Found Fort Ludios and went in for cash and
experience but I underestimated Croesus and died. I only just had time to
remove my amulet of reflection and put on the Amulet of life saving, he
killed me on the same turn as I put it on. I ended up drowning by melting
the ice he was on.

Found a wand on wishing a few levels later and wished for SDSM, Cloak of
MR,Ring of Levitation and Ring of free action. Then I did the quest which
was pretty uneventful.

Spent some time polypiling rings, wands and amulets, then polymorphed to a
rock mole and ate a couple of rings of searching.

Intended to ascend riding a Jabberwock but Jabba I was disintegrated by a
black dragon late in Gehennom and Jabba II suffered exactly the same fate
on the astral plane (after being revived several times)

I have no idea how I became a woman, I'm sure I didn't put on an amulet of
change. Oh Well.

